---
import BaseHead from "../components/BaseHead.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import { SITE_TITLE } from "../consts";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title={`Privacy Policy | ${SITE_TITLE}`}
			description="Privacy Policy for ResizeForge"
		/>
		<style>
			main {
				width: 720px;
				max-width: calc(100% - 2em);
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 3em 1em;
			}
			h1 {
				margin-bottom: 0.5em;
			}
			h2 {
				margin-top: 1.5em;
				margin-bottom: 0.5em;
			}
			p {
				line-height: 1.6;
				color: var(--gray-dark, #333);
				margin-bottom: 1.5em;
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
			<p><strong>Last Updated: August 23, 2026</strong></p>
			<p>
				Welcome to <strong>ResizeForge</strong> ("ResizeForge," "we," "us,"
				or "our").
			</p>
			<p>
				This Privacy Policy explains how information is handled when you
				visit or use <strong>ResizeForge.online</strong> and the online tools
				provided through the website (collectively, the "Service").
			</p>
			<p>
				ResizeForge is designed to provide simple, free online tools
				while minimizing the amount of personal information required
				from our users.
			</p>
			<hr />
			<h2>1. About ResizeForge</h2>
			<p>
				ResizeForge provides free online tools for working with images
				and other digital content.
			</p>
			<p>Our tools may include:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Image Resizer</li>
				<li>Image Compressor</li>
				<li>Image Converter</li>
				<li>Image Optimization Tools</li>
				<li>DPI Calculator</li>
				<li>Pixel Calculator</li>
				<li>Aspect Ratio Calculator</li>
				<li>QR Code Generator</li>
				<li>Developer Utilities</li>
				<li>Other online tools</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				The tools and features available on ResizeForge may change over
				time.
			</p>
			<hr />
			<h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
			<p>
				ResizeForge does not require users to create an account to use
				our tools.
			</p>
			<p>
				We do not intentionally collect or maintain a database of users'
				image files or image-processing results.
			</p>
			<p>
				Depending on the tool, information entered or files selected by
				a user may be processed directly in the user's web browser.
			</p>
			<p>
				We may, however, receive or process certain technical
				information automatically through our hosting, security,
				advertising, analytics, or other third-party services.
			</p>
			<hr />
			<h2>3. Image Files and Browser-Based Processing</h2>
			<p>
				Many ResizeForge tools are designed to process files directly in
				your browser.
			</p>
			<p>When a tool performs processing entirely within your browser:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Your original image remains on your device.</li>
				<li>
					The image does not need to be uploaded to a ResizeForge
					server.
				</li>
				<li>
					ResizeForge does not intentionally store the original image.
				</li>
				<li>
					ResizeForge does not maintain a database of your uploaded
					images.
				</li>
				<li>Processing takes place locally on your device.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				For example, when using an image resizing or compression tool,
				your browser may perform the resizing or compression locally
				using technologies such as JavaScript and browser APIs.
			</p>
			<p>
				The exact processing method may vary depending on the specific
				tool.
			</p>
			<hr />
			<h2>4. No User Accounts</h2>
			<p>
				ResizeForge currently does not require users to create an
				account.
			</p>
			<p>You can use our tools without providing:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>A username</li>
				<li>A password</li>
				<li>An account profile</li>
				<li>Personal registration information</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				We may introduce additional features in the future that could
				change this approach. If that occurs, this Privacy Policy will
				be updated as appropriate.
			</p>
			<hr />
			<h2>5. Information You Voluntarily Provide</h2>
			<p>
				Some features, such as contacting us, may allow you to
				voluntarily provide information.
			</p>
			<p>For example, if you contact us by email, we may receive:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Your email address</li>
				<li>Your name, if provided</li>
				<li>The contents of your message</li>
				<li>Any other information you voluntarily provide</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				We use this information to respond to your request, provide
				support, investigate problems, or communicate with you regarding
				your inquiry.
			</p>
			<p>We do not sell contact information to third parties.</p>
			<hr />
			<h2>6. Automatically Collected Information</h2>
			<p>
				When you visit ResizeForge, certain technical information may be
				automatically processed by our hosting provider, security
				services, advertising providers, analytics services, or other
				third-party services.
			</p>
			<p>This information may include:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>IP address</li>
				<li>Browser type</li>
				<li>Device type</li>
				<li>Operating system</li>
				<li>Referring website</li>
				<li>Pages visited</li>
				<li>Date and time of access</li>
				<li>Approximate geographic information</li>
				<li>General website usage information</li>
				<li>Technical information about your browser or device</li>
			</ul>
			<p>This information may be used for purposes such as:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Operating the website</li>
				<li>Security and fraud prevention</li>
				<li>Detecting malicious activity</li>
				<li>Improving website performance</li>
				<li>Understanding website usage</li>
				<li>Measuring advertising performance</li>
				<li>Serving advertisements</li>
			</ul>
			<hr />
			<h2>7. Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>
			<p>
				ResizeForge may use cookies, local storage, pixels, and similar
				technologies.
			</p>
			<p>
				These technologies may be used by ResizeForge or by third-party
				services operating on the website.
			</p>
			<p>They may be used for:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Website functionality</li>
				<li>Security</li>
				<li>Advertising</li>
				<li>Advertising measurement</li>
				<li>Analytics</li>
				<li>Remembering preferences</li>
				<li>Preventing fraud</li>
				<li>Improving website performance</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				Some cookies may be placed by third-party services rather than
				directly by ResizeForge.
			</p>
			<hr />
			<h2>8. Google AdSense and Advertising</h2>
			<p>
				ResizeForge may use <strong>Google AdSense</strong> to display advertisements.
			</p>
			<p>
				Google and third-party advertising partners may use cookies and
				similar technologies to serve, measure, and improve
				advertisements.
			</p>
			<p>
				Google states that advertising cookies may be used to serve ads
				based on a user's previous visits to ResizeForge or other
				websites.
			</p>
			<p>
				Google's advertising services may process information for
				purposes including:
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Serving advertisements</li>
				<li>Measuring advertising performance</li>
				<li>Limiting advertisement frequency</li>
				<li>Preventing fraudulent activity</li>
				<li>Improving advertising services</li>
				<li>Personalized advertising where permitted</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				Google requires publishers using AdSense to provide disclosures
				regarding Google advertising cookies and third-party vendors.
			</p>
			<p>
				For information about how Google uses information from websites
				and apps that use its services, visit:
			</p>
			<p>https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites</p>
			<p>
				For information about Google's advertising technologies, visit:
			</p>
			<p>https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads</p>
			<p>You can manage your Google advertising preferences through:</p>
			<p>https://adssettings.google.com/</p>
			<p>
				You can also learn about options for opting out of certain
				third-party vendors' use of cookies for personalized advertising
				at:
			</p>
			<p>https://www.aboutads.info/</p>
			<hr />
			<h2>9. Advertising Consent</h2>
			<p>
				Depending on your location and applicable laws, ResizeForge may
				be required to obtain consent before certain cookies, local
				storage technologies, or advertising-related processing are
				used.
			</p>
			<p>
				For users in the European Economic Area (EEA), the United
				Kingdom, and Switzerland, Google requires publishers serving
				personalized ads to use a Google-certified Consent Management
				Platform (CMP) integrated with the IAB Europe Transparency and
				Consent Framework (TCF).
			</p>
			<p>
				ResizeForge may use Google's Privacy & Messaging solution or
				another appropriate certified CMP to manage advertising consent.
			</p>
			<p>The consent mechanism may allow users to:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Accept advertising-related processing</li>
				<li>Reject certain processing</li>
				<li>Manage advertising preferences</li>
				<li>Withdraw or change consent where applicable</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				Google provides a publisher CMP solution for managing consent
				and advertising privacy requirements.
			</p>
			<hr />
			<h2>10. Analytics</h2>
			<p>
				ResizeForge may use analytics services to understand how
				visitors use the website and to improve our tools.
			</p>
			<p>Analytics information may include:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Pages visited</li>
				<li>Browser information</li>
				<li>Device information</li>
				<li>Referring pages</li>
				<li>Approximate geographic information</li>
				<li>General interaction information</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				We do not intentionally send the contents of your uploaded
				images to analytics services.
			</p>
			<p>
				If analytics services use cookies or similar technologies,
				applicable consent requirements may apply.
			</p>
			<hr />
			<h2>11. Cloudflare</h2>
			<p>
				ResizeForge may use <strong>Cloudflare</strong> for hosting, content
				delivery, DNS, security, performance optimization, and other infrastructure
				services.
			</p>
			<p>
				Cloudflare may process technical information associated with
				visitors accessing the website, including information necessary
				to provide security and performance services.
			</p>
			<p>
				For more information, please review Cloudflare's Privacy Policy:
			</p>
			<p>https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/</p>
			<hr />
			<h2>12. Third-Party Services</h2>
			<p>
				ResizeForge may use third-party services to operate and improve
				the website.
			</p>
			<p>These services may include:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Hosting providers</li>
				<li>Content delivery networks</li>
				<li>Security providers</li>
				<li>Advertising providers</li>
				<li>Analytics providers</li>
				<li>Consent management platforms</li>
				<li>Other technical service providers</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				Third-party services may process information according to their
				own privacy policies and applicable laws.
			</p>
			<p>
				We recommend reviewing the privacy policies of third-party
				providers for additional information about their practices.
			</p>
			<hr />
			<h2>13. File Privacy</h2>
			<p>
				ResizeForge is designed to minimize the transmission and storage
				of files.
			</p>
			<p>
				When a tool processes an image entirely within your browser, the
				image does not need to be uploaded to our servers.
			</p>
			<p>
				However, users should understand that not every future tool or
				feature may necessarily operate entirely within the browser.
			</p>
			<p>
				The processing behavior of each tool may be described on its
				individual page.
			</p>
			<p>
				Users should avoid uploading confidential or sensitive files to
				any online service unless they understand how the particular
				tool processes those files.
			</p>
			<hr />
			<h2>14. Data Security</h2>
			<p>
				We take reasonable measures to protect information handled
				through ResizeForge.
			</p>
			<p>
				However, no website, Internet transmission, or electronic
				storage system can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
			</p>
			<p>
				We recommend that users avoid submitting sensitive personal
				information unless it is necessary for the requested service.
			</p>
			<hr />
			<h2>15. Data Retention</h2>
			<p>
				ResizeForge does not intentionally maintain a database of images
				processed through browser-based image tools.
			</p>
			<p>
				When an image is processed entirely within your browser, the
				image remains on your device and is not intentionally stored by
				ResizeForge.
			</p>
			<p>
				Information voluntarily provided through communications, such as
				email, may be retained for as long as reasonably necessary to
				respond to requests, provide support, maintain records, resolve
				disputes, or comply with legal obligations.
			</p>
			<p>
				Technical information processed by third-party providers may be
				retained according to their respective policies.
			</p>
			<hr />
			<h2>16. Children's Privacy</h2>
			<p>
				ResizeForge is not intentionally directed toward children under
				the age of 13.
			</p>
			<p>
				We do not knowingly collect personal information from children
				under 13.
			</p>
			<p>
				If you believe that a child has provided personal information to
				us, please contact us so that appropriate action can be taken.
			</p>
			<hr />
			<h2>17. Your Privacy Rights</h2>
			<p>
				Depending on your location and applicable laws, you may have
				rights regarding your personal information.
			</p>
			<p>These rights may include:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>The right to access personal information</li>
				<li>The right to request correction</li>
				<li>The right to request deletion</li>
				<li>The right to object to certain processing</li>
				<li>The right to restrict certain processing</li>
				<li>The right to withdraw consent where applicable</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				Because ResizeForge does not maintain a database of
				browser-based image processing data, we generally do not have
				access to images processed entirely on your device.
			</p>
			<p>
				For privacy-related requests, please contact us using the
				information provided below.
			</p>
			<hr />
			<h2>18. International Visitors</h2>
			<p>
				ResizeForge may be accessed by users from different countries.
			</p>
			<p>
				Third-party services used by ResizeForge may process technical
				information in countries other than the country where you are
				located.
			</p>
			<p>
				Where required by applicable law, appropriate privacy and
				consent mechanisms may be used.
			</p>
			<hr />
			<h2>19. External Links</h2>
			<p>
				ResizeForge may contain links to external websites and services.
			</p>
			<p>
				We are not responsible for the privacy practices, security,
				content, or policies of third-party websites.
			</p>
			<p>
				We encourage users to review the privacy policies of external
				websites before providing them with personal information.
			</p>
			<hr />
			<h2>20. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
			<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time.</p>
			<p>
				When changes are made, we will update the "Last Updated" date at
				the beginning of this page.
			</p>
			<p>
				We encourage visitors to periodically review this Privacy Policy
				to remain informed about how information is handled.
			</p>
			<hr />
			<h2>21. Contact Us</h2>
			<p>
				If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or ResizeForge's
				privacy practices, please contact us at:
			</p>
			<p><strong>Email:</strong> support@resizeforge.online</p>
			<p><strong>Website:</strong> https://resizeforge.online</p>
			<hr />
			<h2>22. Summary</h2>
			<p>In simple terms:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>ResizeForge does not require an account.</li>
				<li>
					Browser-based image tools can process images locally on your
					device.
				</li>
				<li>
					We do not intentionally store images processed entirely in
					your browser.
				</li>
				<li>
					We do not maintain a database of browser-based image
					processing files.
				</li>
				<li>
					We may process technical information required to operate and
					secure the website.
				</li>
				<li>We may use Google AdSense to display advertisements.</li>
				<li>
					Advertising services may use cookies and similar
					technologies.
				</li>
				<li>
					Appropriate advertising consent mechanisms may be used where
					required.
				</li>
				<li>You can contact us if you have privacy questions.</li>
			</ul>
			<hr />
			<p><strong>© 2026 ResizeForge. All rights reserved.</strong></p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
